FILE paparazzi/models/float_mat_inv_3d/rocq/functional/problem/Spec.v SHA256 32101481abffbff60e2079f28e0ff372106f8ade293d1cf49577ac1337183c25
1: From Stdlib Require Import ZArith.
2: From compcert Require Import Integers Floats Values Memory Events Csem Smallstep.
3: From FivePprzFloatMatInv3d Require Import Execution.
4: From FiveMatInv3Case Require Import Contract.
5: Definition Post(m mf:mem)(bo bi:block)(po pi:ptrofs)(f:Z->float32):Prop:=
6:  OutputBytes m mf bo po f /\ Frame m mf bo po /\ WriteRegion mf bo po 9 /\ OldBlocks m mf /\ OldAccess m mf /\
7:  Mem.loadbytes mf bi(Ptrofs.unsigned pi)36=Mem.loadbytes m bi(Ptrofs.unsigned pi)36.
8: Definition NormalCall:Prop:=forall m bo bi po pi f,bo<>bi->WriteRegion m bo po 9->Reads m bi pi 9 f->
9:  exists mf,(exists t,star Csem.step Execution.ge(Execution.entry(Args bo bi po pi)m)t(Returnstate(Status f)Kstop mf))/\Post m mf bo bi po pi f.
10: Definition AllNormalObservations:Prop:=forall m bo bi po pi f,bo<>bi->WriteRegion m bo po 9->Reads m bi pi 9 f->
11:  forall t v mf,star Csem.step Execution.ge(Execution.entry(Args bo bi po pi)m)t(Returnstate v Kstop mf)->v=Status f /\Post m mf bo bi po pi f.

FILE paparazzi/models/float_mat_inv_3d/rocq/no_error/problem/Spec.v SHA256 451dc871e1818b084b6cd7f47c18208bcbd343ba06157b4e3beb757c0883dacf
1: From compcert Require Import Values Memory.
2: From FiveShared.verification Require Import Obligations.
3: From FivePprzFloatMatInv3d Require Import Execution.
4: From FiveMatInv3Case Require Import Contract.
5: Definition NoError:Prop:=forall args m,FunctionalPre args m->no_error Execution.ge(Execution.entry args m).

